{"id":"233f52378190a961","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound.md","title":"Decision Tree and Certificate Bounds","display":"thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound — Decision Tree and Certificate Bounds","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound","aliases":["28-thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound"],"display":"thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound — Decision Tree and Certificate Bounds","depends_on":["[[28-df-decision-tree]]","[[28-df-certificate-complexity]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 12.5; preceding certificate lower bound","source_printed_pages":"262–263","source_pdf_pages":"288–289","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound — Decision Tree and Certificate Bounds"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4526464ba7e934ba\" href=\"?note=4526464ba7e934ba\" title=\"28-df-decision-tree\">28-df-decision-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f6e59cc4bcadd06\" href=\"?note=4f6e59cc4bcadd06\" title=\"28-df-certificate-complexity\">28-df-certificate-complexity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 12.5; preceding certificate lower bound"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"262–263"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"288–289"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\">\\(D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4526464ba7e934ba\" href=\"?note=4526464ba7e934ba\" title=\"28-df-decision-tree\">28-df-decision-tree</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(f)\">\\(C(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f6e59cc4bcadd06\" href=\"?note=4f6e59cc4bcadd06\" title=\"28-df-certificate-complexity\">28-df-certificate-complexity</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C(f)\\le D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\le C(f)^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C(f)\\le D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\le C(f)^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>下界：任一计算 f 的树在 x 上查询过的坐标确定其叶，因此是 x 的 f(x) 证书。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>上界：令 k=C(f)。维护与已知查询一致的剩余输入；若 f 在其上恒定则停止。否则选一个剩余 0 输入，查询其大小至多 k 的 0 证书中尚未查询的位置。如果回答完全匹配该证书便输出零。任何仍一致的 1 证书必须在某个新查询位置与这次 0 证书冲突；该位置不可能已查询，因为所选 0 输入与旧记录一致。因此每次未停止的迭代都使每个剩余 1 证书的未知坐标数至少减一。最多 k 轮后剩余 1 证书已完全读出（若还有 1 输入），此时剩余函数恒一；否则恒零。每轮至多 k 查询，故至多 k²。常函数 k=0 单独由叶节点完成。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Theorem 12.5; preceding certificate lower bound，印刷页 262–263，PDF 页 288–289。已比对陈述。本次复核来源证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-decision-tree","status":"resolved","id":"4526464ba7e934ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-decision-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-certificate-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"4f6e59cc4bcadd06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-certificate-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-decision-tree","status":"resolved","id":"4526464ba7e934ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]；$C(f)$ 见 [[28-df-certificate-complexity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-certificate-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"4f6e59cc4bcadd06","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]；$C(f)$ 见 [[28-df-certificate-complexity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"C(f)","display":false},{"tex":"C(f)\\le D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\le C(f)^2.","display":true}],"bytes":1868,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-216","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第12章：决策树与证书：[[28-df-decision-tree]]、[[28-df-certificate-complexity]]、[[28-thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["4526464ba7e934ba","4f6e59cc4bcadd06"]}